    <string name="faq_q1">Test kuni qanday hisoblanadi?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Har kuni ilovani kamida 30 soniya ochiq tuting. Ishlatish ruxsati bo\'lsa, bu avtomatik tekshiriladi; bo\'lmasa ilovani Track14 dan ochib, 30 soniyadan keyin qayting.</string>
